y details because clarity is important!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I currently have these specialized skills available:\n\n- **healthcheck** — security hardening, exposure review, firewall/SSH/update checks, OpenClaw host health/risk posture\n- **skill-creator** — create, improve, audit, or clean up AgentSkills / `SKILL.md`\n- **weather** — current weather and forecast\n- **kidney-pipeline-execution** — run the kidney CT pipeline on a newly uploaded CT image and summarize results\n- **llm-distillator** — turn health conversation context + diagnostic tool output into a clear patient-facing explanation\n- **nephrology-klm** — kidney/nephrology-focused expert support\n- **patient-klm** — retrieve or update patient knowledge-base data, timeline, genomics, visits, triples\n- **pipeline-generator** — generate an ML pipeline prototype from a prompt\n\nMy main built-in role, though, is **medical diagnostic support**: reviewing symptoms, screening red flags, and giving cautious differentials. If you want, I can also tell you **when** I’d use each skill.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_097bc014f6fc17ad0169c92022ab4c8191801739815426c879\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":366,"output":250,"cacheRead":9472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10088,"cost":{"input":0.0009150000000000001,"output":0.0037500000000000003,"cacheRead":0.002368,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.007033000000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774788638474}}
